    "title": "Bridgeport (West Virginia) inventor's Callie Baby Bottle wins $10,000 grand prize in The Tank pitch contest | Harrison News | wvnews.com",
    "text": "CLARKSBURG, W.Va. — The Harrison County Chamber of Commerce’s annual business pitch contest — The Tank — saw two winners selected Wednesday night at the Robinson Grand Performance Arts Center.\nSonia Gonzales, a Bridgeport-based inventor, took home the $10,000 grand prize for her invention, the Callie Baby Bottle, a pre-portioned pouch containing baby formula and sterilized water designed with disaster response in mind.",
